# CODEOWNERS — verplichte reviewers per pad.
# Werkt alleen als de genoemde teams/gebruikers schrijfrechten hebben op de repository.
# Zet in branch protection "Require review from Code Owners" aan.
# Laatste match wint; wees dus specifiek onderaan.

# --- Standaard ---
*                                   @[ORG]/tech-leads

# --- Product & Scrum ---
/docs/product/                      @[ORG]/product-owners @[ORG]/ux
/docs/scrum/                        @[ORG]/scrum-masters @[ORG]/product-owners
/docs/research/                     @[ORG]/ux @[ORG]/privacy

# --- Architectuur & besluitvorming ---
/docs/architecture/                 @[ORG]/tech-leads
/docs/architecture/threat-model.md  @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security
/docs/architecture/adr/             @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security

# --- Security, privacy, compliance ---
/SECURITY.md                        @[ORG]/security
/docs/security/                     @[ORG]/security
/docs/privacy/                      @[ORG]/privacy
/docs/compliance/                   @[ORG]/compliance @[ORG]/privacy
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @[ORG]/product-owners @[ORG]/compliance

# --- Pipeline en supply chain (vier-ogenprincipe) ---
/.github/                           @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security
/.github/workflows/                 @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security
/scripts/                           @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security
/.env.example                       @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/security

# --- Gevoelige applicatiepaden: pas aan zodra [TECH STACK] bekend is ---
# Voorbeelden; de paden bestaan pas als de code er is.
/src/auth/                          @[ORG]/security @[ORG]/tech-leads
/src/payments/                      @[ORG]/security @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/compliance
/src/transactions/                  @[ORG]/security @[ORG]/tech-leads
/src/crypto/                        @[ORG]/security
/src/**/migrations/                 @[ORG]/tech-leads @[ORG]/privacy

# --- Tests ---
/tests/security/                    @[ORG]/security
/tests/accessibility/               @[ORG]/ux

# --- Releases ---
/CHANGELOG.md                       @[ORG]/product-owners
/docs/releases/                     @[ORG]/product-owners @[ORG]/security @[ORG]/compliance
